OL,3,AI'm a single mum on #41,000 and limit
OL,4,Amy weekly shop to #40 - it's hard
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is set to unveil
OL,7,Fhis first Budget on Wednesday.
OL,9,FUnlike in previous years there have
OL,10,Fbeen very few leaks about what will be
OL,11,Fin it, though Healey's tax and spending
OL,12,Fplans will be under close scrutiny at a
OL,13,Ftime when government borrowing costs
OL,14,Fare at "historic highs".
OL,16,FBBC News has been speaking to people on
OL,17,Fa range of incomes on how they feel
OL,18,Fabout their finances and what they
OL,19,Fwould like to see in the Budget.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
